    "description": {
      "ready": true,
      "seconds": 0.0,
      "value": "Everyday I watch more and more of my comrades die at the hands of the Charr. Now that they've breached the Wall, I fear that my time may be running out. I haven't seen my wife for over three months. I'm not scared of dying, but I hate the thought of leaving her without at least a final message.<p>My wife lives just outside of Ascalon City. Her name is <c=@Quest>Melka</c>. Please, if you find her, tell her that I love her. It would mean a lot to me. Can you find her and give her that <c=@Quest>message</c>?\n\nReward:<brx>500 Experience<brx>¢khki)<Ta¥npg"
